OL,3,GNEWSA'Racist comments not acceptable' -
OL,4,Acafe owner speaks out over long-running
OL,5,Aabuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe said it was the latest in a number
OL,8,Fof incidents, going back to when she
OL,9,Fworked in a takeaway with her parents,
OL,10,Fand that when she has made reports to
OL,11,Fpolice they are "never followed up".
OL,13,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,14,F(PSNI) said it is "investigating these
OL,15,Fcomments, being treated as a hate
OL,16,Fincident, and conducting enquiries".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
